DESCRIPTION:HCCA is sponsoring our third annual Chili Cook Off contest on 
 Sunday\, November 1 . You are invited to participate in one of two ways: A
 s a chef entering your own homemade chili or as a judge to help select the
  winning entries. There will be Chili's Restaurant gift cards for first ($
 40)\, second ($20) and third ($10) place winners\, based on the favorites 
 selected by the tasting judges\, along with other prizes. Event registrati
 on is requested (select Chef or Tasting Judge). Entry is free! We will be 
 accepting donations and selling baked goods so don't forget to bring a lit
 tle cash with you. There's no better way to spend a fall evening than eati
 ng homemade chili with your neighbors!
LOCATION:Haw Creek\, Asheville\, NC
