DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to join us for a potluck dinner on S
 unday evening\, 6-8 pm\, November 22 at Groce United Methodist Church. Thi
 s event is inspired by the sense of community that many of us experienced 
 in the aftermath of Helene. We gathered to share supplies and food and sto
 ries\, and in the process sometimes came to know our neighbors better than
  we had previously. However\, once our power and water came back online th
